{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126174737642-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126181928\"/><p>大量黃泥水湧出路面。</p><p>今午(26日)5時13分，將軍澳昭信路煜明苑對開有地底水管爆裂，大量黃泥水如噴泉湧出地路，令路面瞬間變成黃河，駛經的車輛如陸上行舟，途人見狀亦改道而行。水亦隨斜路向低處流，並湧山附近單車徑及行人隧道。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.832448+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:47:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:19.440140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:38.310125+00:00","content_hash":"5b5a62627304baf95c9094f0728cb8030c481450cbb4364a29556665c349a286","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}